    "title": "Hot Temps on Tap for Cheyenne, Laramie - NewsBreak",
    "text": "Cheyenne\nHot Temps on Tap for Cheyenne, Laramie\nBy Joy Greenwald,\n9 hours agoCheyenne and Laramie and are expected to see highs in the upper 80s to lower 90s over the next few days. According to the National Weather Service in Cheyenne, a ridge of high pressure will build into the area, ushering in a warming and drying trend through the end of the week.",
